=2 Walkthrough
!The Boyahda Tree-map1.jpg|right|The Boyahda Tree Map 1
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Talk to {n:Apururu} in {z:Windurst Woods} HP #1 inside the northern **Manustery** building (H-9) for a cutscene.
* Zone into {z:Heavens Tower} for a cutscene.
** Optional: Every NPC upstairs (past the Starway Stairway door) has unique dialogue to this mission. Now is your chance to hear what they have to say!
* Click the **Door: Vestal Chamber** on the top floor of the tower for a cutscene with the {p:Star Sibyl}.
* Return to {n:Apururu} for a cutscene.
* Trade {@i:Goobbue Humus|1181} {i:Goobbue Humus|Goobbue Humus|1181} to the single {n:Mandragora Warden} in {z:The Boyahda Tree} at (F-4) in the hidden area of Map 1 for a cutscene. You will receive a {@k} {k:Letter from Zonpa-Zippa}.
** The pair of {n:Mandragora Warden} are the wrong ones.
** {@i:Goobbue Humus|1181} {i:Goobbue Humus|Goobbue Humus|1181} is a drop from the {m:Goobbue Gardeners|Goobbue Gardener} (**{p:R|Rare (5%)}**) found in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah} and {m:Old Goobbues|Old Goobbue} (**{p:UR|Ultra Rare (0.1%)}**) found in {z:The Boyahda Tree}.
** Recommended to farm it with {p:Treasure Hunter} 8 (or any TH) in {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah} which has 13 spawns and 5 minutes respawn. All the {m:Goobbue Gardener} spawns are in the north-east and south-east section of the map.
*** Easiest transportation option is the Level 122 {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah} {p:Unity} warp.
* Return to {n:Apururu} for a cutscene.
* Zone into {p:Full Moon Fountain} for a cutscene that completes the Mission.
** {p:Home Point} #1 to {z:Toraimarai Canal} is the fastest way.

